OL,3,GNEWSAHow a cascade dating back to the
OL,4,A1690s is being fixed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 23 steps that make up the cascade
OL,7,Fat Chatsworth House have been the
OL,8,Fcentrepiece of the stately home's
OL,9,Fgarden for more than 325 years.
OL,11,FBut over the centuries, leakage through
OL,12,Fits stones began to impact the tunnels
OL,13,Funderneath it and put the water feature
OL,14,Fat "significant structural risk".
OL,16,FIt was turned off in 2024 to prevent
OL,17,Ffurther damage and possible collapse,
OL,18,Fbut now a major restoration project has
OL,19,Fbegun there.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
