OL,3,GNEWSAHow a cascade dating back to the
OL,4,A1690s is being fixed
OL,5,
OL,6,FJane Marriott, director of Chatsworth
OL,7,FHouse Trust - the charity that cares
OL,8,Ffor the historic estate - said when
OL,9,Fground was broken on the restoration
OL,10,Fwork on Wednesday, there was a feeling
OL,11,Fof "a bit of relief, excitement, but
OL,12,Falso a real sense of gratitude".
